{"id":"d6ed84d59965705b","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-max-3sat.md","title":"MAX-3SAT","display":"df-max-3sat — MAX-3SAT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-max-3sat","aliases":["28-df-max-3sat","MAX-3SAT"],"display":"df-max-3sat — MAX-3SAT","depends_on":["[[28-df-literal]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","[[28-df-sat]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.1; Definition 11.11","source_printed_pages":"238–239,244","source_pdf_pages":"264–265,270","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-max-3sat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-max-3sat</span><span>MAX-3SAT</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-max-3sat — MAX-3SAT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.1; Definition 11.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"238–239,244"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"264–265,270"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LitVal}_a\">\\(\\mathrm{LitVal}_a\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f3bec18052244e5d\" href=\"?note=f3bec18052244e5d\" title=\"28-df-literal\">28-df-literal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_3\">\\(\\mathcal F_3\\)</span> 是下式定义的非空子句序列实例集，保留重复子句的重数；每个子句含至多三个文字。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 为赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_3\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_3\\)</span> 在下式按有序子句表构造，邻接字串表示连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_3\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\{(C_1,\\ldots,C_m):\\forall j\\in[m]\\ [C_j\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}\\land|C_j|\\le3]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F_3\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\{(C_1,\\ldots,C_m):\\forall j\\in[m]\\ [C_j\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}\\land|C_j|\\le3]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_3(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(m)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_m)\\qquad((C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_3(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(m)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_m)\\qquad((C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_3:\\mathcal F_3\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{enc}_3:\\mathcal F_3\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{j=1}^m\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{LitVal}_a(\\ell):\\ell\\in C_j\\}\\bigr),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\quad(\\varphi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{j=1}^m\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{LitVal}_a(\\ell):\\ell\\in C_j\\}\\bigr),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\quad(\\varphi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>本定义采用书中至多三文字的 3CNF；恰三文字、三不同变量是可额外规定的变体。空子句的最大文字值按零解释。由于实例非空，比例分母有定义；仅有限个变量出现，最优值达到。序列表达保证 PCP 约束复制的权重不被集合去重抹掉。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.1; Definition 11.11，印刷页 238–239,244；PDF 页 264–265,270。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-sat]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"f3bec18052244e5d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathrm{Lit}$ 与 $\\mathrm{LitVal}_a$ 见 [[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-boolean-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"2eb3efc252f058f9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathrm{Lit}$ 与 $\\mathrm{LitVal}_a$ 见 [[28-df-literal]]、[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-sat","status":"resolved","id":"4041cfa2975b8dd1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 为赋值；$\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}$、$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}$ 见 [[28-df-sat]]；$\\operatorname{enc}_3$ 在下式按有序子句表构造，邻接字串表示连接。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,m\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LitVal}_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_3","display":false},{"tex":"a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F_3\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\ge1}\\{(C_1,\\ldots,C_m):\\forall j\\in[m]\\ [C_j\\subseteq\\mathrm{Lit}\\land|C_j|\\le3]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_3(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nat}_{\\mathrm B}(m)\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_1)\\cdots\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{Cl}}(C_m)\\qquad((C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{enc}_3:\\mathcal F_3\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^*.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\coloneqq\\frac1m\\sum_{j=1}^m\\max\\bigl(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\mathrm{LitVal}_a(\\ell):\\ell\\in C_j\\}\\bigr),\\qquad \\operatorname{val}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\max_{a:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}}\\operatorname{sat}_\\varphi(a)\\quad(\\varphi=(C_1,\\ldots,C_m)\\in\\mathcal F_3).","display":true}],"bytes":2283,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"PCP：[[28-df-pcp]]、[[28-thm-pcp]]、[[28-df-gap-problem]]、[[28-df-max-3sat]]、[[28-thm-pcp-gap-hardness]]。"},{"id":"a6ab1076181efd97","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F_3$、$\\operatorname{enc}_3$、$\\operatorname{val}$ 见 [[28-df-max-3sat]]；语言到承诺问题的归约见 [[28-df-gap-problem]]。"}],"outgoing":["f3bec18052244e5d","2eb3efc252f058f9","4041cfa2975b8dd1"]}